   <crs:Description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SNIPED Cultural Documentation v1. Different register from commercial Heroes. Documentary feel: Adobe Color profile, stronger contrast curve (no shadow lift, darks -5, highlights -10), texture +5, clarity +10, sharpening 50 with detail 35 and edge mask 20, muted greens / yellows for environmental light, intentional grain (amount 18 / size 30 / freq 50). Apply on all CulturalDoc keyword shoots.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </crs:Description>
